12:32:00 SQL> -- =========[ Runtime Parameters via command line ]=========
12:32:00 SQL> -- Usage:
12:32:00 SQL> --   sqlplus sysadm/*******@SERVICE @export_delete_script_final6_HR.SQL <DB_NAME> <START_DATE> <END_DATE>
12:32:00 SQL> -- Example:
12:32:00 SQL> --   sqlplus sysadm/*******@FSSNDX    @export_delete_script_final6_HR.SQL FSSNDX 2025-12-01 2025-12-31
12:32:00 SQL> -- Notes:
12:32:00 SQL> --   Dates must be YYYY-MM-DD. End date is inclusive.
12:32:00 SQL> --   Parameter positions: &1=DB_NAME, &2=START_DATE, &3=END_DATE
